flowchart TD
    A([User opens /dustsweep]) --> B[Connect wallet]
    B --> C["Detect in parallel:\nwallet_getCapabilities + eth_getCode (Base)"]
    C --> D[Scan wallet balances]
    D --> E[Token list: swappable / hidden / suspicious]
    E --> F[Select tokens\nmanual / select all / auto-mode]
    F --> G[Choose output token\nETH default, USDC, WETH, USDT]
    G --> H[Quote: best route per token\nvalid 30 min]
    H --> I{"Price impact\non any route > 5%?"}
    I -- yes --> J[Explicit confirmation dialog]
    I -- no --> K
    J -- confirmed --> K{Resolved route kind}
    K -- batch --> L["One-Click:\napprovals + sweep in one\nwallet_sendCalls bundle"]
    K -- permit2 --> M["Sign & Sweep:\nexact approvals (first time)\n+ EIP-712 signature + 1 tx"]
    K -- switch_or_permit2 --> N[Offer switch to owning wallet] --> M
    L --> O[Transaction confirmed on Base]
    M --> O
    O --> P[Success summary + BaseScan link\nfailed legs refunded automatically]
    P --> Q[Record sweep: points & quests]
    Q --> R([Balances rescan])
